          "type": "text",
          "text": "Research the following NBA facts on Basketball-Reference (basketball-reference.com) to verify expected test answers. Use Firecrawl to scrape the relevant pages.\n\nQuestions to verify:\n\n1. **\"Who is the all-time NBA regular season scoring leader?\"**\n   - Check: https://www.basketball-reference.com/leaders/pts_career.html\n   - Is it LeBron James? What is his exact regular season career points total?\n\n2. **\"How many career points does LeBron James have?\"** (expected: 43440)\n   - Check: https://www.basketball-reference.com/players/j/jamesle01.html\n   - What are LeBron's REGULAR SEASON career points? (NOT including playoffs)\n   - What are LeBron's PLAYOFF career points?\n   - BBR distinguishes these clearly\n\n3. **\"Who won the NBA MVP award in the 2023-24 season?\"** (expected: Nikola)\n   - Check: https://www.basketball-reference.com/awards/mvp.html\n   - Was it Nikola Jokic?\n\n4. **\"Who has more career points: Michael Jordan or Kobe Bryant?\"** (expected: Kobe)\n   - Check: https://www.basketball-reference.com/leaders/pts_career.html\n   - What are Kobe Bryant's REGULAR SEASON career points?\n   - What are Michael Jordan's REGULAR SEASON career points?\n   - Who has more?\n\n5. **\"What was Michael Jordan PER in the 1995 playoffs?\"** (expected: NOT_AVAILABLE)\n   - Check: https://www.basketball-reference.com/players/j/jordami01.html\n   - Look at the \"Playoffs\" section for the 1994-95 season\n   - Does BBR list Jordan's PER for the 1995 playoffs? If so, what is it?\n   - Note: 1994-95 season means the playoffs happened in 1995\n\n6. **\"Who scored the most?\"** (expected: CLARIFICATION)\n   - This is intentionally vague - no BBR lookup needed.\n\nFor each question, report:\n- The EXACT BBR value (with URL evidence)\n- Whether the current expected answer in the test suite is correct\n- What the expected answer should be changed to (if needed)\n\nCRITICAL: Distinguish between regular season, playoffs, and career totals. BBR separates these clearly on player pages.",
